--- a/UFSATM/ccpp/physics/physics/Interstitials/UFS_SCM_NEPTUNE/em_gw.F90	1969-12-31 18:00:00.000000000 -0600
+++ b/UFSATM/ccpp/physics/physics/Interstitials/UFS_SCM_NEPTUNE/em_gw.F90	2026-10-17 19:06:04.000000000 -0500
